<translate>
==== RemoveOnBroken ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Parameter for clothes. Specifies whether to delete the item when the state becomes zero.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
RemoveOnBroken = true,
</syntaxhighlight>
